  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "The pattern followed in the given series is:\n\n**(First term - Third term)² = Second term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern to the given sets:\n\n(19, 64, 11)\n\n(__**19 - 11**__)² = 64\n\n__**(8)2**__ = 64\n\n64 = 64\n\n(27, 169, 14)\n\n(__**27**____ - 14__)2 = 169\n__(13)2__ = 169\n169 = 169\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given options:\n\nOption 1) (23, 110, 12)\n\n(__23 - 12__)2 = 110\n__(11)2__ = 110\n121 ≠ 110\n\nOption 2) (20, 200, 8)\n\n(__20 - 8__)2 = 200\n__(11)2__ = 200\n121 ≠ 200\n\nOption 3) (24, 99, 15)\n\n(__24 - 15__)2 = 99\n__(9)2__ = 99\n81 ≠ 99\n\nOption 4) (22, 121, 11)\n\n(__22 - 11__)2 = 121\n__(11)2__ = 121\n121 = 121\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 4)**",
